From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:50:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Repair the integration after the 2026-10-30 upstream sync

Compile, unit-test and style repairs needed once every branch is merged
onto the new develop:

- drop the duplicate MessageSearchStateProvider that MessageSearchStatePreviewParam replaces
- call the inner factory from RustMatrixClientFactory.create
- pass onSearchClick in the MessagesView selection-mode preview
- remove the duplicate appPreferencesStore argument in RoomListPresenterTest
- rename onSendMessage to onMessageInRoom in the conversation service test
- add the missing opt-ins for the coroutines test APIs
- run the focus-on-event and voice recorder tests against the current scope and recorder flow
- fix detekt and ktlint findings in TimelineItemsFactory and AppPreferencesStore

Fork-Feature: integration
